# oracle: fix balance with Nfreq 10 forces a reneighboring on steps 10, 20, ... (native force_reneighbor, next_reneighbor), whatever neigh_modify every 2 delay 4 allows; the builds and the forces follow
units           lj
atom_style      atomic
lattice         fcc 0.8442
region          box block 0 4 0 4 0 4
create_box      2 box
create_atoms    1 box
region          slow block 1 2 INF INF INF INF
set             region slow type 2
mass            * 1.0
velocity        all create 3.0 87287 loop geom
pair_style      lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff      * * 1.0 1.0
neighbor        0.3 bin
neigh_modify    every 2 delay 4 check yes
group           fast type 1
group           slow type 2
fix             0 all balance 10 1.0 shift x 5 1.0 weight group 2 fast 1.0 slow 2.0
fix             1 all nve
thermo_style    custom step temp pe ke etotal press nbuild ndanger
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          5
run             60
